@base = http://localhost:3104
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_TOKEN

### 가입
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student01","password":"long-passphrase-123"}

### 로그인
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student01","password":"long-passphrase-123"}

### 현재 계정
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 비밀번호 변경
POST {{base}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"current_password":"long-passphrase-123","new_password":"another-passphrase-123"}
